{"products":[{"id":15704884248963,"title":"Run Tight Shorts - Black","handle":"run-tight-shorts-black","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Run Tight Shorts are designed for runners who demand more from every stride. The soft and stretchy compressive fabric stays put to help prevent chafing during your longest runs, with mesh panelling to help keep you cool. These shorts feature built-in pants for more coverage, an 8” inseam, discreet inside pockets and a zip pocket to back. Complete with AYBL Run branding to the front and back.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"ul1\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003eMain Fabric: 88% Polyester 12% Elastane, Inner: 89% Polyester 11% Elastane\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003eSoft stretchy compressive fabric\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003e8” inseam\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003eMesh panelling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003eBuilt-in pants for extra coverage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003eDiscreet inside pockets and zip pocket to back\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003eAYBL Run branding to front and back\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"li1\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eModel is 5’11” (1.80m) and wears a size M\u003c!-- notionvc: 4651852f-7fc2-49a1-843c-3855cdfde930 --\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-10-01T18:55:20+01:00","created_at":"2026-02-17T10:44:08+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-03T07:26:17+01:00","vendor":"MENS","product_type":"Shorts","tags":["__badge:New In","feb16import","mens","mens-shorts","run"],"variants":[{"id":57395108872579,"title":"XS","option1":"XS","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AYM5839","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"34.00","grams":200,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":15704884248963,"created_at":"2026-02-17T10:44:08+00:00","updated_at":"2026-10-03T07:26:17+01:00"},{"id":57395108905347,"title":"S","option1":"S"